#~ "The Trend metric is calculated by "
#~ "fitting a linear regression model to "
#~ "the time series and determining the "
#~ "significance of the trend slope by "
#~ "calculating its z-score. Positive z-scores "
#~ "indicate a trend of increasing "
#~ "productivity, while negative scores indicate"
#~ " decreasing productivity. Z-scores reflect "
#~ "the magnitude of the slope, with "
#~ "scores of higher magnitude indicating "
#~ "greater strength of the ongoing process."
